{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act46side_level_act46side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act46side",
  "stageId": "act46side_08",
  "title": "宣告在途",
  "storyCode": "OS-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act46side/level_act46side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6a58c10bde360fd7ba04f15d74865adee53858c55ddce2d326ba8f4276f57159",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "45_g11_karlanheadquarters"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空空荡荡的办公室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "诺希斯并不熟悉这种感觉，他走近办公桌，桌上杯子里，新倒的咖啡冒着热气，下方压着一张有恩希欧迪斯签名的文件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“委任状”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不在公司里告别吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......文件已经签好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你明白这么做的风险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "矿产和土地密不可分，我们绕过蔓珠院，直接与外国合资建设矿区。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未来会有很多麻烦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不在今天付出这些，拉近差距，未来他们只会索要更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，这已是我们能接受的最低代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的结论未免有些乐观，恩希欧迪斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论对任何事，你从不像我这般乐观。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这意味着很多时候，你能比我走得更远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有你的那点“乐观”帮忙，我也不会有黑暗中迈出一步的信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很久没有听到你恭维什么人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_172_svrash_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去完成后面的计划吧，诺希斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "45_g11_karlanheadquarters"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中层以上的员工都到齐了，录像也随时可以开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "直接开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，总监，这次公开会议的内容是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今日召集大家，是要宣布一项重大的人事变动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即日起，恩希欧迪斯·希瓦艾什，将不再担任喀兰贸易的董事长与首席执行官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "由于近期的业务事故，恩希欧迪斯引咎辞职，董事会已经批准了他的请求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同时经董事会决议，本人将接任恩希欧迪斯的全部职务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "由此，我谨代表董事会，向各位同事与谢拉格民众发表喀兰贸易新时期的第一份声明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喀兰贸易将终止和维多利亚方面的一切合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而过去由恩希欧迪斯一意孤行签订的诸多协议，全部暂时搁置，等待董事会做出进一步判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诺希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在如此特殊的时刻，我呼吁各位同事坚守岗位，以谢拉格的发展为重，扫清各类遗留的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n谢拉格需要我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cellroomA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醒醒，我俩来换班了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_286_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不头一回来，还要找地方呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这活儿麻烦吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不耐烦的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_286_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别人都不说话，你管管那个领头的老不死就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪一个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蔓珠院有谁不是老不死吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "众人听完哄堂大笑，随后散去，只留下两个值班的守卫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......说话留点余地，你也是谢拉格人，怎么能对长老出言不逊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还为他说话啊？这帮*谢拉格俚语*把我们祸害成这样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住嘴，不要命啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两名守卫不约而同地看向端坐在牢房内的阿德颂长老，他专心于手边厚重的典籍，捻起书页一角，若有所思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好，还好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有什么好怕的，夸夸其谈了几百年，蔓珠院还能翻天了不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们是耶拉冈德的代行者，你不尊重长老也应该尊重祂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就这个脾气，再说了蔓珠院也配得到尊重？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我母亲生病的时候，修士摘了点草喂给她，让我对着草祈祷，硬说能带来耶拉冈德的庇护。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后去找喀兰贸易的医生，他和我说，病情给修士耽误成这样，哪怕晚一天都救不回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要说代行者，也该是恩希欧迪斯大人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“文士名唤尤尔根，事祂热忱，多行善事。尝有恶徒嫉恨，诬其盗取府库银币，不日将就戮。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“尤尔根手足被重锁束缚，夜闻兵丁刀剑相击，知死期将至，内心忧苦。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗐，看来我知道是哪个老不死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "守卫提起警棍，径直走近阿德颂的监牢，重重敲向铁栏。阿德颂停下诵念，平静地看着他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，老不死的，进了笼子就给我闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想想这辈子造的孽，见了耶拉冈德后还不还得上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“尤尔根仰望亦不见光亮，枉然狱中，跪于草席，向祂哀告......”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“公义的耶拉冈德啊，我难道没有奉你的名施善、奉你的名求道吗？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“难道你的国，只使正直人罹难，而使不义人得救？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“执法律的人，为何听那荒渺的假誓？我所救过的人，为何沉默不语？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*谢拉格俚语*，叛徒也敢觍着脸说这话？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天非得好好教训你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他把警棍架在一边，取出钥匙想要打开牢门，愤怒使他右手发抖，插了几次都对不准锁孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“耶拉冈德啊！我的身陷入囹圄，而我的灵仍在求你的垂怜。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“趁我的眼目能视，我的耳朵能听，向我伸出公义的手吧！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "轻浮的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保证，今天是你的手最后一次翻开《耶拉冈德》！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我做了什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我伤害了我的同僚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做得很好，孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神圣的重担，不止被交给三族，或是圣女和蔓珠院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何谢拉格人，都应当时刻践行祂的意志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一如方才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我记得......“聆悔者尤尔根”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小时候，我在雪山中迷路，即将昏迷的时候，是一位修士救了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在驮兽上，他解下自己的衣袍，紧紧裹住我，讲了尤尔根的故事，说耶拉冈德必将拯救每一位无辜的子民......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，其他修士关押在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谨慎的谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都在这附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寻找时机，将他们都放出来，让他们分散奔逃，保住自己的性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战争正在雪山中酝酿，而蔓珠院会在废墟上建起一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会为你讲述“聆悔者尤尔根”的结局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "30_ex1_snowmount_s"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_285_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_285_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大长老，不要逼我。我们都带着武器，不会放任何人离开这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我会走过你的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿德颂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1998_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若你一定要用弓弩僭越神明的意，瞄准你自己的心，那就试一试吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "谢拉格守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_285_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "闻讯赶来的守卫们列成两队，面面相觑。更多的人选择收起武器，让开了一条狭长的通道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿德颂垂下头颅，从守卫中走过，在雪地留下浅浅的印痕。\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "67_G10_kjeragwilde_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "关节渐渐失去知觉，鞋子一次次陷入松软的雪地，她不停迈着腿，大口吸入冰冷的空气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵——呵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谁，呵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "67_G10_kjeragwilde_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "远方隐约出现了人影，正向她而来，但她的眼前金星忽闪，已然无法辨认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "67_G10_kjeragwilde_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡罗琳女士，我们奉命过来接应你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按理说，应该有人与你一起出来才对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们被谢拉格人抓住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，情报没有问题吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你可以去通知公爵阁下，隐藏在谢拉格背后的力量消失不见了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我观测并记录了某次天外来物的坠地，随之而来的天灾也进一步验证了我的判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论能量场说，还是巨兽假说，都可以解释谢拉格发生的变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "带走这个文件夹，我关于谢拉格的几种假说的研究都在里面了，你可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾，卡罗琳女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你应该不会认为，自己私下偷偷联络梅兰德基金会的事，能瞒到现在吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，公爵阁下只让我们带回资料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信谢拉格失去庇护这件事会让她满意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天外来客、巨兽传说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到的这片大地，处处都是尚未揭晓真相的奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你们的眼睛里，只装得下欺诈、盗窃与谋杀，除此之外，一切不过粪土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "要不是为了从谢拉格脱身......\n我怎么会和你们这种人待在一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的投诉，我会如实提交给公爵阁下的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再见了，卡罗琳女士，感谢你对国家的“服务”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她深深地叹了一口气，不知道在为谁而惋惜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烟雾弹？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_399_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌袭！就近分散寻找掩护！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夜色笼罩的灰烟和铳炮声，让雪地一片混沌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到一辆黑色的越野车，从浓烟中冲出。而它身后，陆陆续续出来的维多利亚的特工们，徒劳地向逐渐开远的车辆射击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德基金会特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让你担惊受怕了，卡罗琳女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德基金会特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了避免被维多利亚的人发现，我们花了不少时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德基金会特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "东西都没有落下吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她垂下头，从带出来的资料里，拿出标注着天外来物的那个文件夹，递给了坐在前排的特工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我什么时候可以开始研究？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德基金会特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要着急，女士，我的上峰想先和你谈谈，他对你的课题很感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅兰德基金会特工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信你会和我们相处很长一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡罗琳点点头，突然想起来了什么。\n本要交给维多利亚的“谢拉格报告”，还没来得及递给对方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她打开车窗，任凭寒风涌入，一张张地抽出在谢拉格费尽心血写下的论文，毫不犹豫地往外抛去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夜色下的纸张更显洁白，像新雪降生于荒野。\n它们在风雪中旋转，也在政客掀起的漩涡中旋转。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡罗琳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1999_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还给你了，维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
